    <remarks>The values correspond to the <c>MODEL_TYPE_*</c> constants in Android's <c>InferenceInput.Params</c>. <see cref="M:Android.AdServices.OnDevicePersonalization.InferenceInput.Params.Builder.SetModelType(System.Int32)" /> takes the value as an integer, and the default is TensorFlow Lite. See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/OnDevicePersonalization/+/cc93f1e4164d0a4bb76dd277abc221f4eaf32efb/framework/java/android/adservices/ondevicepersonalization/InferenceInput.java#L132">model type constants</a></format>.</remarks>
